    "title": "How to leave this world",
    "data": {
        "stitches": {
            "aTeacherYesThats": {
                "content": [
                    "A teacher… Yes, that’s what I do for a living. I’ve been doing it for two years now, but it feels like a century… Thank God today’s over.",
                    {
                        "runOn": true
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "Go straight to the pub",
                        "linkPath": "veryGoodAfterEnd",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "Go back to school and finish what‘s necessary",
                        "linkPath": "youAreRightWritt",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "(letter instructions)",
                        "linkPath": "chooseANumberFro",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "pageNum": 1
                    }
                ]
            },
            "veryGoodAfterEnd": {
                "content": [
                    "Very good. After endless hours of explaining things no one seems to understand, my throat is dry, and having a few beers sounds like the best thing to do.",
                    {
                        "option": "„Three Cats“",
                        "linkPath": "byFourOclockTheP",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "youAreRightWritt": {
                "content": [
