            "byFourOclockTheP": {
                "content": [
                    "By four o’clock, the pub ‘Three Cats’ is already almost full. The low-ceilinged room is thick with cigarette smoke and the smell of burnt grease from the kitchen. Several people inside beckon me with conspiratorial, insincere smiles."
                ]
            },
            "maybeThereIsStil": {
                "content": [
